      "accessed": "2026-09-08",
      "locator": "Section 3.6, report pp.43-46",
      "scope": "Primary NIST FDS technical reference describes net solid-surface heat flux as convective plus radiative contributions and couples it to one-dimensional solid conduction. V11K uses only the stated idealized boundary structure, not an FDS fire field."
